  "_sText": "该mod包含三个部分：<b><span class=\"GreenColor\">身体-表情-武器</span></b>。它们是独立的，你可以随意替换使用。<br>启动器推荐XXMI或者ZZMI，可以解决部分贴图错误。<br>发光武器需要安装<a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/531649\">RabbitFX</a>&nbsp;<br><br><span class=\"RedColor\">已知问题暂时无法解决：</span>开启专武特效的第四下攻击动作中，某一帧一半屁股会闪一下。<br><br>这是一个基础版可以切换：<br>“6”武器发光亮度<br>“←”胸部遮挡<br>“↑”披风---项圈<br>“↓”裙子<br>“→”下遮挡<br><br>完整版还包括：手腕、鞋子切换、胸部大小(中杯--大杯--超大杯)、内衣切换、身体贴图（白丝袜--黑丝袜--淫纹--乳汁--字--白色液体）、表情、兔耳<br><br>如果你需要完整版，可以前往我的赞助频道获得：<br><br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/yyzj2025\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a><br><br><em><u>/////From Google Translate:<br><br></u></em>This mod contains three parts: <span class=\"GreenColor\">body - expression - weapon</span>. They are independent and you can replace them at will. The launcher recommends XXMI or ZZMI, which can solve some texture errors.<br>Glowing weapons require <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/531649\">RabbitFX</a>&nbsp;to be installed<br><br><span class=\"RedColor\">Known issues that cannot be resolved for now:</span>&nbsp;In the fourth attack action with the special weapon effect turned on, half of the buttocks will flash in a certain frame.<br><br>This is a basic version that can switch:<br><br>\"6\" weapon light brightness<br><br>\"←\" chest cover<br><br>\"↑\" cloak---collar<br><br>\"↓\" skirt<br><br><div class=\"SelectedElement\">\"→\" bottom cover</div><br>The full version also includes: wrist, shoe switching, breast size (medium cup - large cup - extra large cup), underwear switching, body mapping (white stockings - black stockings - lewd lines - milk - words - white liquid), expressions, rabbit ears<br><br>If you need the full version, you can go to my sponsor channel to get it:<br><br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/yyzj2025\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a><br><br>",
